# Route: guide 15 of 51 of the simulator's completionist route for Undead
# (1199 of 1215 eligible quests, 157.8 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 33 to
# 35, 54 quests, 3.8 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (The Barrens, Thousand Needles, Dustwallow Marsh, Thunder Bluff,
# Orgrimmar): Ratchet -> Honor's Stand -> Ratchet -> The Shimmering Flats ->
# Freewind Post -> Brackenwall Village -> Witch Hill -> Theramore Isle ->
# Brackenwall Village -> Witch Hill -> Brackenwall Village -> Witch Hill ->
# Brackenwall Village -> ….
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): A Host of Evil (6626; Razorfen
# Battleguard 33-34, Razorfen Thornweaver 33-34, Death's Head Cultist 33-34).
#
# Profession quests here are not routed (they need the skill): 6607 Nat Pagle,
# Angler Extreme.
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): Willix the Importer (1144), Blueleaf Tubers (1221),
# Blueleaf Tubers (1221), Deviate Eradication (1487), Deviate Eradication
# (1487), The Glowing Shard (6981), Gahz'rilla (2770), Tiara of the Deep
# (2846), Leaders of the Fang (914), A Vengeful Fate (1102), Testing an
# Enemy's Strength (5723), Necklace Recovery, Take 2 (2284), Rig Wars (2841),
# Rig Wars (2841), The Royal Rescue (4003), For The Horde! (4974), Returning
# the Lost Satchel (5724), Hidden Enemies (5728), Hidden Enemies (5728),
# Slaying the Beast (5761), Slaying the Beast (5761), Changing Tastes (95697),
# Changing Tastes (95697).

